WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:05.230
<b>Coffee Shop Hitotose</b>

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:07.980
I'm back.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.530
Oh, Hina-chan.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.490
I'm back, Miss Landlady.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:16.690
This letter came for you, from your mom.

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:18.840
Really?

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:20.490
<b>180-3003 
1-7-5 Kojoji Minami, 
Higashi Musashimurano, Tokyo 
Sakuragi Hinako-sama</b>

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.500
Let's see...

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.530
Hinako, are you doing well?

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:27.520
Nothing's changed here.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:30.220
When I think of a girl like you who 
can't speak becoming an actress,

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:31.900
it worries me so...

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:33.460
Mom...

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:38.640
So, to see you acting, 
I'll be coming to visit you soon!

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.160
Coming to... visit soon?

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.140
Visit?

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:46.620
Hina-chan?

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:50.020
What?!

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:24.990
<b>We'll Have a Training Camp</b>

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:30.750
I can't believe it... Mom is coming here?

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.060
Hina-chan, what's wrong?

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:35.250
N-N-Nothing!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.130
<i>Wh-What do I do?</i>

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.410
<i>Mom's coming to see me act?</i>

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:42.650
<i>I'll get nervous and turn into 
a scarecrow for sure!</i>

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:47.430
<i>I haven't even been in any real 
performances since the culture festival...</i>

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:48.600
<i>Oh, I know!</i>

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.870
<i>I'll just have to let her see me 
working in the coffee shop</i>

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:54.070
W-W-Welcome.

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:55.270
<i>to give her peace of mind...</i>

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.990
My, what a stylish costume!

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:00.990
Look this way!

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:03.870
<i>No way! That'd be even more embarrassing!</i>

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:06.410
Hina-chan?

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:10.870
<b>When I looked at the flowerbed at school today, there were some flowers that weren't there yesterday. I wondered if someone had planted them.
I wonder if it looked like this. Or this.</b>

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:10.870
<b>The next time I have a sketch assignment in class, I think I'll sketch some flowers from the flowerbed. I wonder if there will be different flowers then. How exciting.
I hope there are sunflowers in the summer.</b>

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:13.540
You're working?

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.630
Yeah, a bit.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:18.130
Oh, right... See this?

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:25.760
<b>Yokomichi Street Shopping District Stamp Rally Event to Be Held 
Our annual Yokomichi Street shopping district stamp rally event will be
 held again this year. We are recruiting local businesses to participate. 
We welcome new businesses, as well as those who participated
 in previous years! We're awaiting your applications!</b>

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:25.760
<b>The Yokonyans Are Rooting for You!</b>

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:25.760
<b>Yokomichi Street Shopping District Restoration Association</b>

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:23.380
There's going to be a stamp rally event 
in the shopping district soon.

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:25.100
Stamp rally?

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:25.760
Yeah.

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:28.770
<b>Bakery</b>

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:28.110
Excuse me!

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.630
Customers visit all the 
participating stores in turn

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:32.060
<b>Greengrocer</b>

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.370
I'd like a stamp, please!

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:32.320
and get a card stamped at each store.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:37.020
<b>Butcher</b>

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:34.600
Thank you!

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:35.490
Then at the end, prizes are awarded.

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:37.020
Yay!

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:41.650
And our shop is going to be 
participating this year.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:43.180
So I was thinking,

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:47.760
what can we do to bring in lots of customers?

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:51.660
I-In that case, why don't we 
do a performance?

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:52.530
Huh?

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:57.290
I've been wanting the Hitotose Troupe 
to have its first performance!

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:01.420
<i>And it would give my mom 
a chance to see me acting, too!</i>

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:06.050
Hina-chan, you've been thinking 
of our troupe that much?

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:09.060
Huh? Ah, no, I...

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:13.060
<b>This month's class goals!
Sleep earlier than usual!
Wake up earlier than usual!</b>

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:13.060
I see...

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:16.770
If that's what you're planning, 
I'll write a script for us.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:20.070
And I'll help with the props and wardrobe.

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:23.300
Thank you, Kuu-chan, Mayu-chan!

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:25.920
Mayu-chan, you should be in the play, too.

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:28.850
N-No way! I don't like 
being in the spotlight,

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:30.830
and I can't memorize lines!

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:34.400
But you did so well 
at the culture festival...

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:38.670
Th-That was out of desperation 
to help Hina-chan!

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:42.840
I thought you'd be perfect 
for an angel or child role.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:48.600
I'm not a child!

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:51.520
Then how about a doll role?

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.230
I'm not that small!

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:59.350
What kind of play should it be?

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.130
I think it should be one both 
adults and children can enjoy.

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.490
How about an adventure story, then?

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:16.110
The main character is a treasure hunter 
who's traveling the world.

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:18.400
That's an awfully large scale...

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:19.880
There it is!

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:22.380
<b>Cave</b>

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:24.310
She wanders into a dungeon,

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:26.380
and enemies try to kill her...

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:29.010
<b>Monster</b>

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:29.010
Monsters attack her...

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:32.930
...and in the end, the enemy's lair blows up.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:37.770
<b>Script</b>

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.920
You want to blow up the shop?!

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:37.770
Let's play it safe and 
do our take on a fairy tale.

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:44.900
Isn't that...

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.200
I can't wait— whoops!

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:46.450
Hinako?

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.370
Are you okay?

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:49.430
Yeah.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:53.180
Where will we practice?

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:55.410
In the usual park.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:59.140
<i>She's being all friendly 
with Chiaki-senpai again!</i>

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:01.340
<i>What are they talking about?</i>

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:06.850
But the park will be 
really crowded on the weekend.

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.490
That's true...

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:11.040
Then why don't we practice in my room?

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:13.060
There's not much furniture, so it's roomy.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:16.660
Yeah, your room is always so tidy.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:19.610
And you have lots of 
stuffed animals in yours.

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:24.690
After coming to Tokyo, I got into 
the habit of collecting stuffed animals...

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.390
They're all very cute.

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:27.620
No fair, Hinako!

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.570
I want to talk about that stuff, too!

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:33.580
<b>Merchandise for the new mascot comes out today! 

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.160
What's the matter, Yua-chan?

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:36.950
The Hitotose Troupe's first performance?

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:39.210
You should have told me sooner.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:42.150
I'm a member of the troupe, you know!

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:43.300
I'm sorry.

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:45.710
We actually just decided to do it yesterday.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.970
Can't we practice in 
the school's empty classroom?

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:53.540
If we say it's for a theater assignment,
 we can get permission.

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:55.810
You think it'll be that easy?

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:58.050
Just leave it to me!

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:00.710
The teachers trust me a lot!

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:01.900
Wow!

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.310
I should've known!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.940
You really do have your act together!

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:12.200
<i>Well, it's more like my stock naturally went up 
as I kept covering for Hinako...</i>

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:16.200
<b>I've been curious about the cake shop that opened in front of the station, so I'll buy a cake from there.
I think I'll buy a cake for Mom, too! I wonder what kind of cake she likes...</b>

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:16.200
<b>I worked really hard today, so my mom gave me an allowance!
Yay!</b>

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:23.180
The cast will be you, me, Kuina,
 and Chiaki-senpai,

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:25.710
and Mayu-senpai is making 
the props and wardrobe, right?

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:26.930
Yeah!

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:29.450
Maybe I'll take care of the makeup.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:31.590
And the landlady's going to make flyers.

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:33.970
She likes to draw, she says.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:37.850
Then maybe she'll do our 
backdrops and scenery, too.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.490
I'm writing the script...

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:43.560
And I'll also take care of picking 
a venue for our after-party.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:45.540
We want a restaurant 
with good, cheap food, right?

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:47.730
Do you guys prefer Japanese or Western food?

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:51.110
You should put more effort into writing 
the script than picking a restaurant...

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:55.610
I-I think I'd like to 
play a tree or a statue.

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:59.010
<i>That way, if I turn into a scarecrow,
 Mom won't notice.</i>

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:01.540
Aren't you the principal?!

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:04.040
So for that reason,

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:07.750
we'd like to borrow the empty 
classroom after school.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.080
Play practice, huh?

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:11.920
This isn't for the theater club?

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.800
No, it's private.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:16.370
All right.

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:18.810
I know it's safe to let 
you use it, Nakajima-san.

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:21.560
It really was easy to get permission!

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.340
That's our Yua-chan!

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:25.060
What did I tell you?

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.560
Hello?

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:30.570
It sounds like you're planning 
something interesting.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.020
Ruri-chan!

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:33.320
Sensei!

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:37.370
I didn't know you had a desk 
in the faculty office, Ruri-chan.

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:40.700
Well, despite my appearance, 
I am a club advisor.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:43.890
Anyway, what is it you're planning to do?

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:48.580
Oh, actually, we'll be putting on 
a theater performance at Hitotose.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:51.820
I see. So that's why you'll be practicing.

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:52.840
That's right.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:57.510
I can't just sit idly by knowing 
you're practicing theater.

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.850
Would it be all right if I joined you?

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.990
What? You will?

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:03.690
As the theater club's advisor,

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:05.520
it's just part of my job.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.850
Wow! Thank you!

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:09.220
On that note,

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:12.230
let's hold a training camp 
here at school this weekend!

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:14.790
Huh? Training camp?

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:17.860
Um, Sensei, a training camp 
on such short notice?

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.220
I can't wait!

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:25.000
I guess you like that sort 
of event, huh, Ruri-chan?

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.050
Sorry!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.430
Packing my things took longer than I expected!

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:42.010
Wow, you brought a pretty big bag.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:42.680
Yeah.

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:47.010
Let's see... I brought my pajamas,

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:51.140
a change of clothes, and...

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:53.190
Well, I brought lots of things.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:56.740
Kuu-chan and Mayu-chan, 
you have big bags, too.

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:58.990
Mine is...

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:01.740
...all books!

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:06.170
Wow! You brought all these
 as references to write a script?

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:06.870
Huh?

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:10.370
Oh, right! They're all for reference!

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:14.380
Sh-She plans to eat them all...

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.380
Hey, look at this!

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:19.640
I brought my favorite stuffed animal!

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:21.890
Oh, I did, too!

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:23.260
This is going to be fun!

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.140
Yeah!

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:26.890
This is shaping up to be 
just a slumber party...

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:33.220
Jeez, you guys are too hyped up 
for just an overnight training camp.

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:39.020
All you need is the bare minimum: 
face wash, toner, moisturizer, and aroma oils.

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:42.180
I'd say those are the things 
we'll need the least.

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:45.790
What do you think is 
most important to bring, then?

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:48.740
Questions like that are common, huh?

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:51.170
Like, what would you take 
to a deserted island?

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:53.620
I'd take a field guide of edible plants.

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:56.050
It's both useful and edible!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:58.300
It won't be useful anymore if you eat it!

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.510
I'd take a water filter.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:01.830
What about you, Hina-chan?

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:04.430
Huh? Well...

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:09.160
Maybe food for all the animals 
that would come to see me?

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:10.450
Eat up.

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:13.190
Worry about getting food for yourself!

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:15.320
Oh, here it is!

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:18.090
This classroom is where we'll be
 training all night!

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:18.690
Oh?

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:21.200
Good morning, everyone.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.470
Ruri-chan, you're already here?

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:24.970
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:26.480
Don't worry about it.

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:29.250
I laid out the futons while I waited.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.960
Huh?! Wh-Why?!

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:38.790
My parents told me the best part of 
a training camp is the pillow fight.

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:39.340
Huh?

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.590
R-Really?

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:45.600
This really is shaping up to be
 just a slumber party...

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:49.470
Well, shall we begin practice?

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:53.120
I'll make dinner while 
you're all practicing.

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:55.110
Thank you!

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:59.810
She isn't an actress in the Hitotose Troupe?

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:03.600
Oh... no, she gets embarrassed easily,

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.920
so she doesn't want to be on the stage.

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:08.460
Maybe I'll change 
into a maid outfit later...

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:12.600
What a shame.

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:14.610
She's such a cute girl.

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:16.980
She's a very good dancer, too.

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:21.510
In that case, why don't 
we debut her as an idol?

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:26.290
Everyone! Are you having a good time?

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:27.890
I think she'd be even more 
embarrassed to do that.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:30.390
There we go.

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:35.330
<i>Okay! Time to polish my acting skills
 so I can impress Mom!</i>

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.270
<i>Hina-chan seems even more driven than usual.</i>

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:45.200
Miss Landlady, is the shopping 
district event very large in scale?

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:47.700
No, it's not that large.

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:54.930
But the shop that draws the most customers 
will receive a bale of rice.

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:57.040
Ah, I see!

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:01.010
You really love to eat, huh, Hina-chan?

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:01.810
Huh?

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:04.930
Oh, no, I fully understand 
where you're coming from!

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:23.530
Well, shall we end our practice for now?

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:26.910
Yes... So tired...

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:34.450
Since it's a training camp, 
I got a bit overzealous.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:35.530
Can't go on...

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:39.040
You two are pathetic, passing out from that!

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:41.980
You're still very energetic, Yua-chan.

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:47.530
Y-Yes! Um, I-I can still 
keep going... I mean, um...

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:51.810
Oh, right! I'm going to go wash my face!

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:16.200
It's raining...

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:40.910
I-It's kind of creepy in here...

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:43.170
The lights keep flickering.

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:46.230
F-Feels almost like a ghost might pop out...

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:50.240
I'll wash up fast and hurry back.

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:04.540
Dinner time...

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:07.920
Y-Yua-chan?!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:08.680
What's wrong?

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:11.610
A ghost! A French doll ghost!

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:13.980
Huh?! A French doll ghost?!

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:15.810
Wh-Where?! Where?!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:19.810
<b>This month's goal: Only 1 cake per day!</b>

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:19.810
<b>Work:
Tues:
Thurs:
Sat:
Buy the ticket by next Thursday!
Diet = Having to exercise somewhat. In order to continue things you don't like doing, it's important to do what you can every day.</b>

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:23.060
Let's eat!

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:29.860
Mayu-chan, your vegetable curry is so good!

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:32.240
You're right! It's really good!

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:34.620
My, it is delicious.

00:15:38.110 --> 00:15:40.660
What's your favorite food, Hina-chan?

00:15:40.930 --> 00:15:42.960
I like all vegetables!

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.690
The ones we could pick back home 
were the best, though!

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:48.380
Fresh-picked is always better, isn't it?

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.050
What's your favorite, Mayu-chan?

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:53.750
I like shortcake and Hamburg steaks.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:57.780
I like nanbu senbei, salt-grilled saury...

00:15:57.780 --> 00:15:59.280
Oh, and plum-and-kelp tea.

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:03.490
Most of the foods I like are the things
 that you like the least, huh?

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:04.320
Yeah.

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:08.190
You two really are opposite extremes...

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:15.910
The school is kind of creepy 
at night, isn't it?

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:20.040
By the way, have you heard of 
this school's seven mysteries?

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:22.540
Huh? It has those?

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.170
Your school didn't have anything 
like that, Hina-chan?

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:27.420
I'm quite interested, too.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.550
Hmm... Did we?

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:32.420
Oh, yeah!

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:36.510
I think there was a walking 
Ninomiya Kinjirou,

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:39.180
a Ninomiya Kinjirou 
that suddenly grew heavy,

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:41.830
a dancing Ninomiya Kinjirou,

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:43.870
<i>I don't want them to think I, 
Yua-sama, was scared by a ghost!</i>

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:43.910
the Ninomiya Kinjirou in the mirror,

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:48.060
<i>I'm not leaving this classroom again 
for the rest of the night!</i>

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:45.560
a stain on the wall that 
was Ninomiya Kinjirou,

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.060
a Ninomiya Kinjirou with shining eyes, and...

00:16:50.180 --> 00:16:51.360
There.

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:54.630
Hina-chan, could you go get a washrag 
from the home ec classroom?

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:55.200
Ah...

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:56.820
I'll go!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:00.330
<i>Crap! I just said that out of habit!</i>

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.770
Okay, you can both go together.

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:03.830
Sure!

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:14.840
<i>I'm not scared... I'm not scared!</i>

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:20.350
Um, the home ec room is this way, right?

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:31.240
Ah, so that's why Mayu-chan gave me this.

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:36.610
Hey... W-Wait for me!

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:42.990
<i>I knew I shouldn't have 
left the classroom...</i>

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:45.000
<i>I'm so scared, I feel like I'll pass out!</i>

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:48.670
Yua-chan, do you not like dark places?

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:54.690
That's not... not... not true...

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:56.260
Aren't you scared, Hinako?

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:58.890
Well, a little...

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:02.300
But you always help me out,

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:05.270
so I thought I should be 
there for you this time.

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:09.770
Y-You're just Hinako...

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:14.100
Oh, fine. I guess I'll hold your hand.

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:15.530
Be grateful!

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:21.160
<i>Well, this is still a lot brighter 
than the countryside at night.</i>

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.920
Hey! Why'd you stop?

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.200
Something's there.

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:33.920
Huh?

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:36.590
Wh-Where?

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:38.300
See? Right there.

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:40.980
Th-There's nothing there!

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:46.560
H-Hey, Hinako! Wait for me!

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:50.640
H-Hinako?

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:52.560
Hinako, come on!

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:02.340
H-Hinako?

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:12.870
Yua-chan, look! It was a kitty!

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:15.280
I guess it wandered in here and got lost.

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:23.090
Yua-chan?!

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:31.460
Easy, Kuu-chan.

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:34.800
Aren't training camps fun?

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:37.360
I wish we could stay over at 
school every weekend.

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:39.490
I've had enough.

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:41.890
After spending the day with all of you,

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:44.640
I've got some ideas for my script!

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:46.160
It's a horror story, though...

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:48.490
Yua-chan?!

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:50.280
Are you okay?

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:51.620
<i>Everyone's having fun, and all is well.</i>

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:52.340
Open your eyes!

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:54.670
<i>I guess this kind of training camp 
could be nice once in a while.</i>

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:56.410
By the way...

00:19:57.320 --> 00:20:00.720
When do we get to have the pillow fight?

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:03.510
You're really stuck on that, huh, Sensei?

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:06.310
Goodnight.

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:17.520
Hinako, are you awake?

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:24.420
I mean, it's fine if you're not.

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:31.640
Um... Thanks for earlier.

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:35.540
It was really reassuring having you ther—

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:42.690
Yua-chan?! Yua-chan?

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:44.340
What happened?

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:44.340
What?

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:47.550
Is something wrong?

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:47.550
A burglar?! Is there a burglar?!

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.570
The training camp was so much fun.

00:20:57.570 --> 00:20:59.570
Last night was awful for me, though.

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:04.250
I'm sorry. I can't sleep 
without that mask on...

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:06.680
I-It's not like I was scared or anything!

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:08.650
It just startled me!

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:12.780
"It just startled me."

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.080
Kuu-chan, are you writing the script?

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:18.960
Yep! I think it'll be done 
by the end of this week!

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:21.360
Wait, you didn't...

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:24.410
Don't worry. It's not a horror story.

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:26.470
I'm <i>not</i> scared of that stuff, okay?!

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:29.860
<i>The script and our practices 
are coming along well.</i>

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:31.270
<i>If we keep this up,</i>

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:34.030
<i>I think I can be confident on the stage!</i>

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:37.730
<i>I'll make sure Mom sees me at my best!</i>

00:21:38.010 --> 00:21:40.510
I can't wait until the day of the event.

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:41.110
Yeah!

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:47.110
Let's make the Hitotose Troupe's 
first performance a success!

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:48.250
Hinako...

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:52.400
Hina-chan, is a bale of rice 
that appealing to you?

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:55.000
Huh? Bale of rice?

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:33.050
<b>Pa-Pa-Parade</b>

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:31.790
Kuu-chan finally finished the script for 
the Hitotose Troupe's first performance!

00:23:31.790 --> 00:23:34.500
Which means it's my time to shine!

00:23:34.500 --> 00:23:37.390
Everyone, try on these costumes right away!

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:39.460
Next time, "Pa-Pa-Parade."
